---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SERVICES, INDUSTRIES, BLUEPRINT, BOOKING_URL } from "../data/site";
import hero from "../assets/hero_executives_teaching.png";
import blueprintArt from "../assets/bullseye_blueprint_methodology_infographic_concept.png";

// Every figure below is traceable to a specific engagement in Douglas's CV.
// Labels state the baseline so the number cannot be read as more than it is.
const stats = [
  { to: 40, prefix: "$", suffix: "M", label: "Revenue scaled from $5M in three years" },
  { to: 460, prefix: "$", suffix: "M", label: "Capital originated and closed" },
  { to: 35, suffix: "%", label: "Gross profit margin, up from 19%" },
  { to: 5, suffix: "-day", label: "Month-end close, down from 15 days" },
];
---

<Base
  title="Bullseye Strategies | Fractional CFO & ERP Consulting for Mid-Market Companies"
  description="Fractional CFO leadership, ERP implementation, FP&A, and operational discipline for mid-market companies. Certified Disability-Owned Business Enterprise based in Houston, Texas."
  path="/"
>
  <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
  <section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-navy-950 pb-24 pt-36 sm:pb-32 sm:pt-44">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
      <Image
        src={hero}
        alt=""
        widths={[900, 1400, 1920]}
        sizes="100vw"
        class="hero-media h-full w-full object-cover object-center opacity-30"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-navy-950/85 via-navy-950/70 to-navy-950"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>
        Certified Disability-Owned Business Enterprise
      </p>

      <h1
        class="mt-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05] text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
        data-reveal
      >
        Fractional CFO leadership for companies that have
        <span class="text-crimson-400">outgrown their systems.</span>
      </h1>

      <p
        class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-350"
        data-reveal
      >
        Most consultants hand you a deck and an invoice. We combine CFO
        strategy, ERP implementation, and operational discipline&mdash;then stay
        through execution.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4" data-reveal>
        <a
          href={BOOKING_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="rounded-full bg-crimson-500 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-white transition-colors hover:bg-crimson-600"
          >Schedule a Discovery Call</a
        >
        <a
          href="/services"
          class="rounded-full border border-white/25 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white/10"
          >Explore Services</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= STATS ================= -->
  <section class="border-y border-paper-200 bg-white">
    <div
      class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-4"
    >
      {
        stats.map((s) => (
          <div data-reveal="stagger">
            <p class="font-[var(--font-display)] text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-navy-900 sm:text-5xl">
              <span
                data-count-to={s.to}
                data-count-prefix={s.prefix ?? ""}
                data-count-suffix={s.suffix ?? ""}
              >
                {s.prefix ?? ""}
                {s.to}
                {s.suffix ?? ""}
              </span>
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-navy-700/70">{s.label}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 pb-10 text-xs leading-relaxed text-navy-700/50 sm:px-8">
      Results achieved by Douglas Dillard in operating roles at companies from
      $5M to $350M in revenue. Revenue and margin figures are from Moderno
      Porcelain Works (2021&ndash;2024); capital figures combine $400M+ in
      construction financing originated and closed at DC Partners with $60M in
      debt and equity raised at Moderno; close-cycle reduction is from Cosentino
      North America.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= POSITIONING ================= -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 sm:py-32">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-20">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">The Problem</p>
        <h2
          class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-navy-900 sm:text-[2.6rem]"
        >
          The reporting stopped being trustworthy somewhere around $20M.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-navy-800/80" data-reveal>
        <p>
          It rarely announces itself. The close slips to eleven days. Two people
          produce three versions of the same margin number. The ERP you bought
          three years ago runs as an expensive database while the real decisions
          happen in a spreadsheet on someone's desktop.
        </p>
        <p>
          That is not a software problem, and a strategy deck will not fix it.
          It takes someone who can read the balance sheet, configure the system,
          and sit with your controller through a close. Rare combination. It is
          why this firm exists.
        </p>
        <p class="border-l-2 border-crimson-500 pl-5 font-medium text-navy-900">
          &ldquo;I built Bullseye to be the partner I always wished I had as a
          CFO&mdash;someone who understands the numbers but also knows how to fix
          the engine.&rdquo;
          <span class="mt-2 block text-sm font-normal text-navy-700/60"
            >Douglas Dillard, MBA &mdash; Founder</span
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= SERVICES ================= -->
  <section class="bg-paper-100 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">What We Do</p>
        <h2
          class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-navy-900 sm:text-[2.6rem]"
        >
          Six disciplines, run by one accountable partner.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-navy-800/70">
          Engagements usually combine two or three. You are not handed off to a
          junior team after the sale.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {
          SERVICES.map((s) => (
            <a
              href={`/services#${s.slug}`}
              class="lift group rounded-xl border border-paper-200 bg-white p-7 hover:border-crimson-500/40 hover:shadow-[0_18px_50px_-24px_rgba(14,27,46,0.4)]"
              data-reveal="stagger"
            >
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">{s.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-crimson-600">{s.lede}</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy-800/70">
                {s.body}
              </p>
              <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-navy-900">
                Learn more
                <svg
                  viewBox="0 0 16 16"
                  class="h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2"
                >
                  <path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                </svg>
              </span>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= BLUEPRINT (sticky scroll) ================= -->
  <section class="bg-navy-950 py-24 text-white sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">The Methodology</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight sm:text-[2.6rem]">
          The Bullseye Blueprint
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-350">
          Five phases, run in order. Each produces a deliverable you keep, whether
          or not you continue.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-20">
        <div class="hidden lg:block">
          <div class="sticky top-32">
            <Image
              src={blueprintArt}
              alt="The five-phase Bullseye Blueprint methodology"
              widths={[500, 800]}
              sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 90vw"
              class="scroll-zoom w-full rounded-xl border border-white/10"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <ol class="space-y-4">
          {
            BLUEPRINT.map((step) => (
              <li
                class="lift rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7 hover:border-crimson-500/50"
                data-reveal="stagger"
              >
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
                  <span class="font-[var(--font-display)] text-2xl font-extrabold text-crimson-500">
                    {step.n}
                  </span>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">{step.title}</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-350">{step.body}</p>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-450">{step.detail}</p>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= INDUSTRIES ================= -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 sm:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Sector Depth</p>
      <h2
        class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-navy-900 sm:text-[2.6rem]"
      >
        We speak your industry's vocabulary on day one.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-navy-800/70">
        No ramp-up spent explaining what WIP or a field ticket is.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      {
        INDUSTRIES.map((ind) => (
          <div
            class="lift rounded-xl border border-paper-200 bg-white p-8 hover:border-crimson-500/40"
            data-reveal="stagger"
          >
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-900">{ind.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-navy-800/70">{ind.body}</p>
            <ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              {ind.tags.map((t) => (
                <li class="rounded-full bg-paper-100 px-3 py-1 text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-navy-700">
                  {t}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= DOBE ================= -->
  <section class="bg-maroon-700 py-20 text-white sm:py-24">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-10 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between"
    >
      <div class="max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
        <p
          class="text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70"
        >
          Supplier Diversity
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight sm:text-[2.4rem]">
          Engaging us counts as Tier 1 diverse supplier spend.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-white/80">
          Certified by Disability:IN as a Disability-Owned Business
          Enterprise&mdash;one of fewer than 1,100 worldwide. If you carry
          supplier-diversity or ESG targets, this engagement counts toward them
          with no tradeoff on the work.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/dobe-certified"
        class="shrink-0 self-start rounded-full bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-maroon-700 transition-colors hover:bg-paper-100 lg:self-auto"
        data-reveal>View Certification</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= CTA ================= -->
  <section class="rings bg-navy-900 py-24 text-center text-white sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 sm:px-8" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight sm:text-[2.6rem]">
        Ready to hit your target?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-350">
        45 minutes, no deck, and an honest read on whether we can help.
      </p>
      <a
        href={BOOKING_URL}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="mt-9 inline-block rounded-full bg-crimson-500 px-8 py-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-white transition-colors hover:bg-crimson-600"
        >Start the Conversation</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
